{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "4697c5e03469b1eb0fc78b3aa0b421149e476ec559714e3654863a54caff04a5", "ja": "ほころび", "zh": "破绽", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0d9dcb355e45a1d403b3ba8aa46489d7fa1127e10cbe9dfb1ebe412d84385c50", "ja": "エレナ・百合子が星梨花に近付く事を警戒\nする千鶴は、ケガをした生徒の瘴気に気付き\n歌織・風花と話す。学園長は魔法界の封印の\n綻びを掴むが、学園の秘密書庫に忍び込んだ\n星梨花達は触媒を求め魔女の森へと向かう。", "zh": "警惕着艾蕾娜、百合子接近星梨花的千鹤，察觉到受伤学生身上的瘴气后，  \n与歌织、风花交谈。学园长发现魔法界封印出现了破绽，  \n而潜入学园秘密藏书库的星梨花等人，为寻找催化剂前往魔女之森。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "8bbac8a7bf668fc30753b03c1b087e1e13819e4ad26303a5fb3409dd259c9928", "ja": "星梨花！　すこしは、私の話を聞いてくれ！\nパートナーだろう？", "zh": "星梨花！你至少听我把话说完！我们不是搭档吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "c7b10db4e99a6104cb4f91b0fbcd87bf325a03007e10acd2c07587c86e570484", "ja": "……どうせまた「古代魔法は危険だ！」でしょう？\nもうわかったから、通してください。邪魔です。", "zh": "……反正你又要说“古代魔法很危险！”吧？\n我已经知道了，让我过去。你挡路了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "656df41544b7d015cc29612c8dbd5ed1ce290e0ac8cfa2c1e33726b923c71d55", "ja": "違うんだ、そうじゃなくて……いや、違わないが！\nもちろんそれも問題だが、今日は違う話だ。", "zh": "不是那样，不是这个意思……不，虽然也不是完全不对！当然那也是问题，但今天要说的是另一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "d868d573c4e1b12745e9c8b98d5a9db66c1ed0cede2570eb902b5a994ba4777b", "ja": "ええと……。\n最近、エレナや百合子と一緒にいるそうだな？", "zh": "那个……听说你最近经常和艾蕾娜、百合子待在一起？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "646caeb8b2a232853ab3433ba803672d36732af77ee6e02afbe84d45364bb93c", "ja": "ええ。おふたりと仲良くしていますが、\nそれがどうかしましたか？", "zh": "是的，我和她们两位相处得很好。  \n有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "23eaa4829d8c232ff0f5765df7df1a531d5d695c2c749b115213f52369d9b06c", "ja": "あいつらは危険だ。近づかない方がいい。\n何を考えているかわかったものでは……。", "zh": "那两个人很危险。还是不要靠近为好。\n根本不知道他们在想什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "0ece7ba6667e6dd0f7cc1b31e782ba139b1a02f0ef95280bd960575923ca7a33", "ja": "千鶴さん、わたしは小さい子どもじゃありませんよ。\n……テスト勉強したいので、失礼します。", "zh": "千鹤姐姐，我已经不是小孩子了哦。\n……我想复习考试，先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "8b34c0f3781aa7d9a70c41666221ed8d5a4b79fbc74bc9df1363c71428f37149", "ja": "（ダメだ、聞く耳を持ってくれない。\nこうなったら、直接ふたりに……）", "zh": "（不行，他们根本听不进去。既然这样，只能直接去找他们两个了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "f28aebd6b6d3137fb761dc3acc427ac65906732c0425670d946940bcec0f2a7c", "ja": "お前達、どういうつもりだ？", "zh": "你们到底想干什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "23d9bb44109233428089c3959ce6eb2e99628e6e67842dd74d192558ffbda080", "ja": "あれ～、チヅル？　どうしたの、コワ～い顔して。\nあ！　もしかして、ワタシと戦ってくれるの！？", "zh": "哎～呀，千鹤？你怎么啦，脸色好吓～人哦。\n啊！难道说，你是要来跟我打一场吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "ca1560b3165bb613adb8d8343c231871cdfddaf53bebc3afd36cf16b3622d40c", "ja": "お前達、星梨花をたぶらかすな！　あの子はまだ、\n子どもなんだ。物事の判断がついていない。それを……", "zh": "你们别哄骗星梨花！她还只是个孩子，\n还不能判断事情。可你们却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "bbb37d66171ed7cc9228af15290a6d6c618b836f5ce623a949ec0c4d86023464", "ja": "あーあ……。千鶴さん、そうやって星梨花さんを\n子ども扱いするの、よくないと思いますよ～？", "zh": "唉～……。千鹤小姐，我觉得像那样把星梨花当小孩子看待，可不太好哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "aeeedc11494ac86dfbd05d5abde3ca902319a348c6c2fc810e5278e2d0a93e88", "ja": "ねっ、星梨花さん？", "zh": "对吧，星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "07fa5d101d69d4487fdb96d7766be9b85c2caef5769295f5bb403d6eed3e262c", "ja": "なっ……！？\nせ、星梨花！　どこに……！？", "zh": "什……！？\n星、星梨花！你去哪儿了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "c5ac0f5bf0ae4769c4d2cbe13391e684eb328066f108b43f28060eb5d04415e2", "ja": "……。いいですよ、別に。\n行きましょう、百合子さん、エレナさん。", "zh": "……没事，没什么。\n我们走吧，百合子、艾丽娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "96bd541ba09a44ac2727aa099f66f97ab0c7efd312b3d942cb453c9312b3acd0", "ja": "しまった、星梨花のいないところで話すつもりが……\n仕方がない。奥の手を使おう。", "zh": "糟糕，本来打算在星梨花不在的地方谈的……  \n没办法，只好使出最后手段了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "d31e93e3a4f7cad74dd059bf3e23abefb40b74d231fbdb25de370648e58a4189", "ja": "ル・ルル・ペルル、コリエ・ドー……\n黄金の門より来たれ、偉大なる獣……ケルベロス！", "zh": "露·噜噜·佩露露，黄金项链……  \n从黄金之门降临吧，伟大的魔兽……刻耳柏洛斯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1018_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "3eb32e2e4e612f7bac4ae47a86e871d84d84402e14253ce98bd126da34683c76", "ja": "アオォーンッ！　ハッハッハッ……。", "zh": "嗷呜——！哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "5f2148f598ce4904b89ffa7b91c6b17360db172a125162ba62a2d5212d935b75", "ja": "ケルベロス、星梨花のことを頼めるか？\n姿を隠して、あの子を守ってやって欲しい。", "zh": "刻耳柏洛斯，星梨花就拜托你了。\n希望你能隐藏身形，保护好那个孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1020_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "a27e1a5c8a3a63d557db0602ebc5918133eda8120d94b720958de9bea6c42734", "ja": "ワオォーンッ！", "zh": "嗷呜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "76c7f292e15bc6a811535061ad37eecb87035f815695081e4eb0c700f852a1e8", "ja": "よし、と……。\nひとまず、これで様子を見るしかないな……ふぅ。", "zh": "好，先这样……  \n暂时也只能先观察一下了……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1022_seito", "source_sha256": "6580f57e6aa9121add504bf0a8bcf0c285c1a7296e63acdbb579a5f146b9d1fd", "ja": "うぅっ、イタタタ……。", "zh": "呜……好痛痛痛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "323c09fdd7948457f58825180083f89ca967578beb18a557d9ffd5b704eb0f1f", "ja": "……？　どうした？\nその傷、瘴気を感じるが……魔物でも出たのか？", "zh": "……？　怎么了？\n那道伤口，感觉带有瘴气……是有魔物出现了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1024_seito", "source_sha256": "864323e662795e3447613760b34d12f12563b8b326ad57837cc19948261f5d75", "ja": "えっ？　あ、千鶴さん！　いえ、攻撃魔法の授業で\n加減を間違えてしまっただけなんですけど……。", "zh": "诶？啊，千鹤小姐！不是的，我只是在攻击魔法课上不小心没掌握好力度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "0786e62de326d4f1c4888fc21b7c361e404ff8a6e9242d3f07092f222f688d4f", "ja": "加減を間違えた……そうか。次は気をつけるといい。\n今なら歌織がいるだろう、彼女に手当てをしてもらえ。", "zh": "弄错了分寸……这样啊。下次注意点就好。\n现在歌织应该在吧，让她帮你处理一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1026_seito", "source_sha256": "a3b746ce83114914c627efc6c9637e947ea90410156519bf5c251d7f6d59697b", "ja": "は、はいっ！　失礼します！", "zh": "是、是！打扰了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1027_se", "source_sha256": "632766b1963bbd5d65cd118f29217ec32140023fcf0802dafb4fd7ef14cacead", "ja": "パタパタパタ……", "zh": "啪哒啪哒啪哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "8a36f1a4c7643303374a09d2e5cf83dadf1832dd4a178240dba7d4ebbfd6d8c0", "ja": "（加減を間違えた、だと？\nなら、この瘴気はどういうことだ……？）", "zh": "（弄错分寸了？那这股瘴气又是怎么回事……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "a83e2c45edd38b070c5b04a2866b7979dc2915d373c6d090b85fafb87e1577e3", "ja": "ふぅ……今日もケガをする人、多いなぁ。\nこの調子だと、マナが足りなくなっちゃうかも……。", "zh": "呼……今天受伤的人也很多啊。\n照这样下去，魔力可能会不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "d1fc4f6fe634f883551e26c833b29bf2c01b39397f95d59e7035143f67d81364", "ja": "失礼するぞ、歌織……と、風花も一緒か。\n今、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "打扰了，歌织……还有，风花也在一起啊。\n现在方便耽误一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "109770d0994497e75dabe5d3d84a68d5ca153e8505aac70a172f41b9cce9eb22", "ja": "あら千鶴、どうかしたの？\n魔瞳の大鷲のエリートさんが、こんな所に来るなんて。", "zh": "哎呀千鹤，怎么了吗？\n魔瞳大鹫的精英，居然会来这种地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "17202390286972281c5dedaa909cf40ff6d2dbb502133fcd25f49a97c174d652", "ja": "今、怪我をした生徒が来ただろう？\n傷から瘴気を感じて、気になってな。何か知らないか？", "zh": "刚才有位受伤的学生来过吧？\n我从伤口感觉到了瘴气，有些在意。你知道些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "f3c878b1ab68817e7da8edbdb579d3209225d85e7ce823a6c3a5b66566a8beb6", "ja": "！　風花ちゃん……！", "zh": "！风花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "89b8ca1e848f03b3a75ce136be8211ef127daab18ed4fcdf4138a531d5ac7599", "ja": "ええ……最近、ああいう怪我が多いのよ。\n私たちもそれに気づいて、調べているところ。", "zh": "嗯……最近，那种伤经常出现呢。\n我们也注意到了，正在调查。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "d67d17fb224eb8e2d266b15a654806ec5aed8e52fb5c8f896db8304ce7b7b40e", "ja": "魔法の制御に失敗したとか、転んだとか……。\n理由はなんでもないの。でも……何かがおかしい。", "zh": "可能是没能控制好魔法，或者摔了一跤……并不是什么特别的理由。可是……总觉得有哪里不对劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d5fdb90755b73115cfbada48e5345d44f272c5274e1b07d5a31746235354cbdb", "ja": "先生方にはまだ報告したばかりで、返事はないの。\n私たちで、注意しておくべきかもしれないわね。", "zh": "才刚向老师们报告过，还没有收到回复。\n或许我们应该先留意一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "3a66b93c329bda05ee957e928b07d7e0dc30bf5529e368bbd67eb493f6e40947", "ja": "そうだな……\n何か、いやな予感がするんだ。", "zh": "是啊……\n总觉得有种不好的预感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "5c7f2b8b7b9b89bb0ce4ff0d4290065f1b023db61596748e19caefc410c0f842", "ja": "学園長～？　ただいま戻りましたよ～。\n久し振りの『塔』は、肩が凝りました～。", "zh": "学园长～？　我回来了哦～。\n久违地去了一趟“塔”，真是肩膀都酸了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1040_025roc", "source_sha256": "5b5144e6fcca9f5affb33ae08349a577da647dda5a07d5e9b7dd1b64a5cd871d", "ja": "ウェルカムバックです、トモカ！\n早速ですけど、インフォームをお願いします。", "zh": "欢迎回来，朋花！\n虽然有点突然，但请告诉我情报。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1041_031tom", "source_sha256": "a6e4ac7bb08da64cf919c087a49c99b261cc9d32040766e97afb34f8b5734bb6", "ja": "ええ。学園長の予想通りでした～。\n魔法界のあちこちで、封印が綻び始めているようです。", "zh": "是的，正如校长所预料的那样～  \n魔法界各处的封印似乎都开始松动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "d76998850c0275615b096a74b527e628c746d12f1c3d56d4f9c2585fe3091d20", "ja": "先日の古代魔法の発動が、どうやらカギになっている\nみたいですね～。早速先生方に知らせて、対処を……。", "zh": "看来，前几天发动的古代魔法，似乎就是关键呢～。赶紧通知各位老师，采取对策……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1043_025roc", "source_sha256": "e25bf9b7da550a15f2827ddc371163b2a57f3ba56204019dace8edbbd24751e4", "ja": "ウェイトです、トモカ！\nこのことはまだ、先生たちに知らせてはいけません。", "zh": "等等，朋花！\n这件事暂时还不能告诉老师们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1044_025roc", "source_sha256": "b7b3fdb9500ea9aae124983d107b4e12ed19ea9638ca817cf4a59946ec5167da", "ja": "夢想の鯨、水晶蹄の馬、魔瞳の大鷲……。レイカに、\n各寮の監督生たちを集めてもらってください。", "zh": "梦想之鲸、水晶蹄之马、魔瞳之大鹫……去让丽花\n把各宿舍的级长们召集过来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1045_se", "source_sha256": "4de95a10126d9ee8216a8775db12f4130874fbeba176ab5919d8065bf3cc300f", "ja": "ガチャ、ギイィィー……", "zh": "扭蛋，吱呀呀——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "bbfe45ad766aa6ea5f2c05728aed4ee594d8c97247eb3384ac823d2483b0cc84", "ja": "これは……全部、魔法書！？\n百合子さん、ここは一体……。", "zh": "这些……全都是魔法书！？  \n百合子小姐，这里究竟是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb2c7a82b3cc8976f81457ba224ac936a1ae5b67c9de89c854b340fe35bf7eba", "ja": "そう！　学園の中でも、限られた先生たちしか\n入れないという、秘密の魔法書庫です♪", "zh": "没错！这里就是据说只有少数老师才能进入的、学园里的秘密魔法书库♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1048_018ele", "source_sha256": "01bf2e8f99415c64d7996ab031d1dc54fc2247a6f73c5671a5dca38da8c260e2", "ja": "あれ？　でもここって、すっごく厳重な\n魔法鍵が掛かってるって……なんで開いてるの？", "zh": "咦？可是这里不是说，被施加了非常严密的\n魔法锁吗……怎么是开着的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "a007740536c026f687a0caad688c66874d0c69ad045d746351ba45386ff15341", "ja": "誰か調べものをしているのか、たまに開いてるんです。\nとにかく……星梨花さん、約束は守りましたよ♪", "zh": "可能是有人在查资料吧，偶尔会打开着的。总之……星梨花，我遵守约定了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1050_018ele", "source_sha256": "e38f50e2073a67ed8e5f66e4b74aacb928edaf3e4eae2998f6ba664bd7b4f83a", "ja": "わぁ～……！　見てよ、この紋章の術式！\n古代魔法レベルじゃない？", "zh": "哇～……！快看这个纹章的术式！\n这都达到古代魔法的水准了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1051_022ser", "source_sha256": "07f436a0afda6a18eb741cbc71f117dddf57787f690ff131025202d27b41d755", "ja": "こっちもすごいです。うちの書庫にもないような\n貴重な本が、こんなにもたくさん……。", "zh": "这边也好厉害。居然有这么多珍贵的书籍，连我们家的藏书室里都没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1052_026yur", "source_sha256": "961b6d3098623dd4d195e0d7e4102c9f869133cd37752654587dccb6d4758ecc", "ja": "まさに、知の宝庫ですね！　こんなすごい書物を\n先生方だけで独占しているなんて、ズルいなぁ～。", "zh": "真不愧是知识的宝库呢！老师们居然\n独自霸占着这么厉害的书籍，太狡猾啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1053_022ser", "source_sha256": "c1193c747536b6103f1b52a8eabba385fb1830fe55344842c4938ba6d0636c81", "ja": "『より力の強いものを召喚するには、\n術者が開く門を物理的に大きくし、マナを通す』……", "zh": "『若要召唤更加强大的存在，\n术者便需从物理层面扩大开启的门扉，引导玛那通过』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1054_022ser", "source_sha256": "5ccb19d69cb34ee9ba0ca04722be0943f4c89e5fc7787e10e74534976559354f", "ja": "以下の召喚に必要な触媒は、次元の砂、魔獣の鎖骨、\n銀月花の蜜と……『極光の涙石』……？", "zh": "接下来的召唤所需的媒介是次元之砂、魔兽的锁骨、银月花的花蜜，还有……“极光之泪石”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1055_018ele", "source_sha256": "8c84094bca153aca8e625b2ca7a31e7f9af29f0f6f0152b931814f451a167bd4", "ja": "魔法史の授業で聞いたかも……魔法界のはずれにある、\n魔女の森に封印されてるっていうやつじゃない？", "zh": "我好像在魔法史课上听说过……是不是那个被封印在魔法界边缘的女巫之森里的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1056_026yur", "source_sha256": "1777662fef93a3a4d641ab9284199613ac824b755d2d509fe02bed79445841f6", "ja": "封印！？　なんて素敵な響き……！\nいかにも古代魔法って感じで、ワクワクしてきました♪", "zh": "封印！？多棒的字眼啊……！\n简直太有古代魔法的感觉了，让人好兴奋♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1057_026yur", "source_sha256": "12a0b4ec9d716a86c56e91937803abdf18d64a8618c0572d61ecfbfcb1a42d00", "ja": "ウワサでは、相当危険な場所らしいですけど……\n当然、行きますよね？", "zh": "听说那地方相当危险……\n不过，当然要去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_03_1058_022ser", "source_sha256": "d428400bb36400bf255113d0053b5661d3aeba85b11b4719a574f235efc54cd8", "ja": "もちろんです。\n……わたし、ホウキを取ってきます！", "zh": "那是当然。\n……我去拿扫帚来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
